sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SH as Stage Handler
    participant AM as AdapterManager
    participant AH as AdapterHookService
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>Inbound Endpoint
    participant EC as External<br/>Controller

    Note over SH,EC: Inbound Webhook Flow - Blocking Approval Gate

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Note over SH,AM: Step 1: Adapter Execution Triggers Inbound Wait
        SH->>AM: executeAdapters(stage:0, step:newSessionRequest, point:after)
        AM->>AM: findBindings() returns inbound-approval adapter
        AM->>AM: hasInboundWebhook = true
        AM-->>SH: disposition: SKIP<br/>message: awaiting external controller callbacks
    end

    rect rgb(254, 249, 195)
        Note over SH,AH: Step 2: Gateway Pauses and Waits
        SH->>AH: registerPendingDecision(adapterId, sessionId)
        AH->>AH: pendingDecisions.set(adapterId, Promise)
        Note over AH: Transfer paused<br/>timeoutMs: 300000 (5 min)
    end

    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
        Note over GW,EC: Step 3: External Decision Arrives
        EC->>GW: POST /api/v1/adapters/inbound/newSessionRequest-approval
        Note over EC: Body: adapterId, continue, reason
        GW->>GW: validateInboundDecision(payload)
        GW->>AH: resolveDecision(adapterId, decision)
    end

    rect rgb(254, 226, 226)
        Note over AH,SH: Step 4: Decision Applied
        AH->>AH: pendingDecisions.get(adapterId).resolve(decision)
        
        alt continue: true
            AH-->>SH: blockingDecision: CONTINUE<br/>reason: Approved by Alice
            SH->>SH: Resume transfer flow
        else continue: false
            AH-->>SH: blockingDecision: ABORT<br/>reason: Failed sanctions check
            SH->>SH: Abort transfer, log reason
        end
    end

    Note over SH,EC: Transfer continues or aborts based on decision
